      "verified": true,
      "answer": "The Notifiable Data Breaches scheme, which is part of the Privacy Act 1988, is not in this environment. Therefore, we cannot state what it requires or whether a laptop theft legally triggers a statutory notification obligation. However, we can answer from the provided policies of Acme Pty Ltd.\n\nAccording to \"Acme Pty Ltd \u2014 Data Security and Retention Policy (Internal), 4.1\", any suspected data breach must be reported to IT Security immediately, who will assess it within 24 hours; if the breach is likely to result in serious harm, they will escalate it to the Privacy Officer for notification under the Notifiable Data Breaches scheme. Under \"Acme Pty Ltd \u2014 Data Security and Retention Policy (Internal), 4.2\", notifications to the OAIC (the Commissioner) and affected individuals will be made as soon as practicable after becoming aware of an eligible data breach. Additionally, \"Acme Pty Ltd \u2014 Employee and Contractor Data Handling Policy (Internal), 3.1\" provides that company-issued laptops are encrypted and enrolled in mobile device management, which may prevent unauthorized access and affect the assessment of whether serious harm is likely.",
      "draft_text": "{\n  \"answer\": \"The Notifiable Data Breaches scheme, which is part of the Privacy Act 1988, is not in this environment. Therefore, we cannot state what it requires or whether a laptop theft legally triggers a statutory notification obligation. However, we can answer from the provided policies of Acme Pty Ltd.\\n\\nAccording to \\\"Acme Pty Ltd \\u2014 Data Security and Retention Policy (Internal), 4.1\\\", any suspected data breach must be reported to IT Security immediately, who will assess it within 24 hours; if the breach is likely to result in serious harm, they will escalate it to the Privacy Officer for notification under the Notifiable Data Breaches scheme. Under \\\"Acme Pty Ltd \\u2014 Data Security and Retention Policy (Internal), 4.2\\\", notifications to the OAIC (the Commissioner) and affected individuals will be made as soon as practicable after becoming aware of an eligible data breach. Additionally, \\\"Acme Pty Ltd \\u2014 Employee and Contractor Data Handling Policy (Internal), 3.1\\\" provides that company-issued laptops are encrypted and enrolled in mobile device management, which may prevent unauthorized access and affect the assessment of whether serious harm is likely.\",\n  \"citations\": [\n    {\n      \"clause_id\": \"acme/data-security-policy:v1:4/1\",\n      \"quote\": \"Any suspected data breach must be reported to IT Security immediately. IT Security will assess the breach within 24 hours and, where the breach is likely to result in serious harm, escalate to the Privacy Officer for notification under the Notifiable Data Breaches scheme.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clause_id\": \"acme/data-security-policy:v1:4/2\",\n      \"quote\": \"Notifications to affected individuals and to the OAIC will be made as soon as practicable after Acme becomes aware of an eligible data breach.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clause_id\": \"acme/employee-policy:v1:3/1\",\n      \"quote\": \"Company-issued laptops and mobile devices are encrypted and enrolled in our mobile device management platform, which enforces automatic locking, remote wipe capability, and mandatory security updates.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
      "draft_citations": [
        {
          "clause_id": "acme/data-security-policy:v1:4/1",
          "quote": "Any suspected data breach must be reported to IT Security immediately. IT Security will assess the breach within 24 hours and, where the breach is likely to result in serious harm, escalate to the Privacy Officer for notification under the Notifiable Data Breaches scheme."
        },
        {
          "clause_id": "acme/data-security-policy:v1:4/2",
          "quote": "Notifications to affected individuals and to the OAIC will be made as soon as practicable after Acme becomes aware of an eligible data breach."
        },
        {
          "clause_id": "acme/employee-policy:v1:3/1",
          "quote": "Company-issued laptops and mobile devices are encrypted and enrolled in our mobile device management platform, which enforces automatic locking, remote wipe capability, and mandatory security updates."
        }
      ],
